<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Banco Itau still attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Banco Itau still attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Bear Stearns said it was maintaining its attractive rating on Brazil's Banco Itau after the bank announced it would assume control of insurer Itau Seguros from its holding company Itausa.</p>
<p>-- The move was aimed at consolidating all of Itau's insurance business, a report issued by the securities firm said.</p>
<p>-- Banco Itau common stock closed up 0.6 percent at 505 reais on Wednesday, while its preferred shares ended down 0.5 percent at 593 reais on the Sao Paulo bourse.</p>
<p>((--Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
